repository-code: "https://github.com/i-bacic/optimal-networks"
abstract: >-
  Code and data to reproduce the numerical results of the
  manuscript "Symmetry breaking in minimum dissipation networks".
  The code computes locally optimal supply networks that minimize
  the average dissipation of linear flows under a global resource
  constraint and fluctuating injections, scans the parameter
  space, and classifies the optima as symmetric, weakly
  symmetry-broken or strongly symmetry-broken.
keywords:
  - optimal transport networks
  - symmetry breaking
  - supply networks
  - power grids
  - network science
